OL,3,GNEWSACharity offers to meet James
OL,4,AMcClean over therapy comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday night, his wife Erin
OL,7,Fresponded on social media, saying she
OL,8,Fhad been "strongly encouraging him to
OL,9,Fseek therapy" and that he was
OL,10,F"struggling at the moment".
